      "username": "andrei.semenov",
      "name": "Andrei Semenov",
      "created_at": "2026-02-17T12:39:54.232Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As of now, ERPNext does not support SAF-T PT out-of-the-box. The Portuguese Tax Authority (AT) requirements are quite specific, especially regarding invoice signing and the XML schema structure. We are an integrator based in Portugal, and we are currently in the process of official certification with the Tax Authority (AT) for our localized solution. This includes SAF-T PT XML generation and digital signature compliance. While we are finalizing the certification, we can discuss how to implement this for your business to ensure you are compliant. DM here or telegram: <span class=\"mention\">@asmnff</span></p>",
